{"v":{"Cupra/Ateca/Ateca":{"s":[["",[["N87","ok","Nižja od N11, zato boljši pogled nazaj. Visoka le 60 cm – ni za visoke pse. Zaradi navpičnih stranic je zgoraj in spodaj široka 88 cm – optimalna za kompaktne srednje velike pse z nizko postavo in kratkimi nogami. Sega le do vzglavnikov, pogled v vzvratno ogledalo ostane prost."],["N11 N15 N18 N19 N20","shown","Prikazana v vozilu; podrobnosti glejte pri Seat Ateca."]]]],"i":["Cupra Ateca je enak kot Seat Ateca, zato ustrezajo iste kletke – če konfiguracija tu ni prikazana, poglejte tudi Seat Ateca."],"p":{"N11":[["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_2FC336-4F5675-B39497-6EF00D-637F22-732565.jpg","Brez dvignjenega dna"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_39D06B-587669-7A6646-090B8A-5BBBA7-EDB8D5.jpg","Brez dvignjenega dna"]],"N15":[["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_E15BCD-C628D9-384E0A-3677F7-3E406A-FC5D97.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_156F65-E7BA02-40C728-2C46ED-97710A-8360F4.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_064B47-0124E7-B40571-98361D-9AF6FC-1D8D62.jpg"]],"N18":[["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_B9254F-7ABE29-57AFF5-014D6F-328966-507F72.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_5EFDFC-800167-0E9125-C5027C-9D63CC-4A50EC.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_5210C7-DAD7B3-516F40-E137D1-831B69-577111.jpg"]],"N19":[["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_922F43-7CEBF0-720944-B7B7BB-48FD15-D09087.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_99446C-AB3DFF-31F48D-B564DA-BFD2B1-EEF67F.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_9AE51A-949BE3-7BAC04-935859-90D73C-FE6016.jpg"]],"N20":[["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_F4CC65-248246-01F493-0B510F-E4BB8F-085975.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_E904D7-B7AC9E-D6BFD8-C70100-0C3394-8E25B5.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_45F5A8-D8E667-6C206D-314F44-4118D7-E18783.jpg"]],"N87":[["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_D61030-42AD1F-EBB2BF-D73D1F-ACDF01-9E831E.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_3FF036-D1B080-9A8048-08EF04-710832-80884C.jpg"],["Cupra_Ateca/IMG_C9E253-237F5B-A42A22-470110-39241C-F4A51A.jpg"]]}},"Cupra/Born/Born":{"s":[["",[["N17 N36","ok",""],["N97","ok","Potrjeno s fotografijo kupca."]]]],"i":["Prtljažnik je presenetljivo prostoren."],"p":{"N36":[["Cupra_Born/IMG_A2D5F2-F78799-F38996-D81B2F-EA37BF-8F18E3.jpg"],["Cupra_Born/IMG_44BC74-F603F0-023948-F666A8-D96BFD-9C22DF.jpg"],["Cupra_Born/IMG_51EF6C-1369C5-C6E7B2-9A32B8-B02043-75F9BA.jpg"]],"N97":[["Cupra_Born/IMG_A1C4A3-2CB25F-A561D2-701917-CFB495-A217AA.jpg"],["Cupra_Born/IMG_A670E1-785EFF-E0B0F5-D4C3CC-FA7285-E4A3BD.jpg"]]}},"Cupra/Formentor/Formentor":{"s":[["",[["N87","adapt","Razvita posebej za Formentor – največja možna kletka (G × Š × V 73 × 88 × 60 cm), z dvignjenim robom vrat. Ustreza le, če je nakladalni rob ~11 cm; pri nižjem ne ustreza. Prilega se tako natančno, da je treba pred vstavljanjem sprostiti zaskok sedežev in jih nato spet zaskočiti. Zgornji rob je ~2–3 cm od zadnjega stekla, zgoraj ob strani ~2 cm od okvirja – kljub videzu na fotografijah se pokrov prtljažnika zapre."],["N18 N19 N20","small","Le za manjše pse. Pri vstavljanju sprostite zadnjo klop in jo podrite naprej, nato jo vrnite. Kletko postavite bolj na sredino, da ne zadene zadnjega stekla."],["N60 N65 N67","ok","Kletke, kot je N60, so smiselno uporabne največ za avstralskega ovčarja – večji psi v njih nimajo dovolj prostora."],["N17","no","Ne ustreza (označeno na fotografiji)."]]]],"w":["Zaradi močno padajoče strešne linije je izbira kletk omejena. Dno prtljažnika mora biti v zgornjem položaju."],"p":{"N17":[["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_A33252-33CB9C-DDCB57-A44FAE-EDD8DD-5A4704.jpg"],["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_FD5796-6BBA1C-EB5D09-2756D6-766D1E-F7E604.jpg"]],"N19":[["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_668E06-A52EE9-24FD67-6BDBE8-07FBAF-2C2168.jpg"],["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_231A30-F83DB5-317C35-DDE712-60426E-7962BE.jpg"]],"N60":[["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_6D596B-B9394C-66F318-8F2330-D30558-53E970.jpg"],["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_A3F48E-52CA8E-CB857F-945288-8AE633-837038.jpg"],["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_657539-0393CE-775703-789731-01C465-E19FAF.jpg"]],"N65":[["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_B84975-FA8356-868F9C-831C94-A456C9-454842.jpg"],["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_72C7AF-41B3A0-FED186-D98E4A-B33CAF-621776.jpg"],["Cupra_Formentor/IMG_E22AEA-9D4B5A-924D5A-83572C-5455D3-C19B19.jpg"]],"N87":[["Cupra_Formento